   "en": "To start out, do the focuses ⟦0⟧, ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧, ⟦3⟧ and S⟦4⟧. Build up your Industry, Civilian Factories first, especially in Transvaal, as that will give you another achievement, ⟦5⟧, as well. Do not build an army, but do produce a variety of equipment to build one later, I usually add at least a few factories on ⟦6⟧ and ⟦7⟧ as those are very useful. For political advisors, get the ⟦8⟧, the ⟦9⟧ and the ⟦10⟧. Around mid to late 1938 do the Focus ⟦11⟧, (followed by A ⟦12⟧) this will trigger the South African civil war. To win this, rush for the supply depots and encircle your out of supplies enemies and destroy them where possible. Going for ⟦13⟧ will be very useful as it grants you both ⟦14⟧ to use Force attack more often and ⟦15⟧, however, ⟦16⟧ should also work just fine. ⟦17⟧ at the latest and join the Axis. Build up an army of at least ⟦18⟧, add whatever you like to add, I went with ⟦19⟧, later adding Logistics as well. When Italy joins the Axis, set up a ⟦20⟧ order from ⟦21⟧ to ⟦22⟧ ⟦23⟧. Wait until the Axis gain ⟦24⟧, you probably won't be able to help a lot with this but it will happen anyways, then launch your naval Invasion. ⟦25⟧.",
   "frags": 26
  },
